// gleam_erlang, reviewed against the source of 0.34.0.
// A message sent to a process escapes to code graded does not see: sending
// runs it. A selector holds its handlers and runs them when it receives; what
// a process receives from its mailbox is undescribed.

covers 0.34.0
container gleam/erlang.Reference
container gleam/erlang/atom.Atom
container gleam/erlang/charlist.Charlist
container gleam/erlang/node.Node
container gleam/erlang/port.Port
container gleam/erlang/process.Pid
container gleam/erlang/process.Timer
reviewed gleam/erlang.get_line
reviewed gleam/erlang.priv_directory
reviewed gleam/erlang/process.call
reviewed gleam/erlang/process.link
reviewed gleam/erlang/process.monitor_process
reviewed gleam/erlang/process.new_subject
reviewed gleam/erlang/process.receive
contract gleam/erlang/process.send(message: [message]) : [Process] where runs : [message]
reviewed gleam/erlang/process.sleep
reviewed gleam/erlang/process.sleep_forever
reviewed gleam/erlang/process.start
reviewed gleam/erlang/process.try_call
reviewed gleam/erlang/process.unlink
